{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"ox_harness","model_identifier":"ox_harness","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# ox_harness\n\nOx harness (Patch 5): draught harness for `ox`, for the cart team, built like `horse_harness`.\n\nA timber neck yoke with bows, a padded collar, a back pad, a belly band, rope traces with leather links running back to the cart, and a small bridle. Built on the full ox skeleton (same bone names and pivots) with a copy of every ox clip (same names and keys), so it can be bound to the ox skeleton or played in sync with the ox. `slot_trace_r` (11, 46, 32) and `slot_trace_l` (-11, 46, 32) on `body` mark the ends of the traces.\n\n- Cubes: 15. Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Bounds at rest: x -15..15, y 28..63, z -59..32 u.\n- Clips: `idle`, `walk`, `run`, `pull`, `charge`, `graze`, `injured`, `death`."},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"beam_yoke#7a5230","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-15,53.5,-31],"to":[15,58,-26.5],"autouv":0,"color":8,"origin":[-15,53.5,-31],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,79,30,84],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[120,79,125,84],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[30,79,60,84],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,84,5,89],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[60,79,90,84],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[90,79,120,84],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7edfd795-470e-2997-46b6-59101d576c90"},{"name":"beam_bow_r#8a6038","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[6.4,35.5,-30.6],"to":[8,57,-28],"autouv":0,"color":1,"origin":[6.4,35.5,-30.6],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[68,0,70,22],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[56,0,59,22],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[70,0,72,22],"texture":0},"we