lation":"linear"}]},"d9deeea0-5d0e-5eed-9d88-dedab4e160ae":{"name":"foot_back_l","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false,"keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"-2.432","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"9495ec8e-9b72-59bf-be4b-be5454f5f785","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"-42.088","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"318b7685-ee9b-59d2-aed6-1724cbbf2397","time":0.448,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"0","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"95250bab-cc10-5225-bdc9-8127d409a69f","time":0.96,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"-25","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"679584ba-9374-50f7-9569-ebd9c73c0e94","time":1.36,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"-25","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"a2eebee5-c032-51f8-9503-270595698fce","time":1.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"}]}}}],"description":"# ox_harness\n\nOx harness (Patch 5): draught harness for `ox`, for the cart team, built like `horse_harness`.\n\nA timber neck yoke with bows, a padded collar, a back pad, a belly band, rope traces with leather links running back to the cart, and a small bridle. Built on the full ox skeleton (same bone names and pivots) with a copy of every ox clip (same names and keys), so it can be bound to the ox skeleton or played in sync with the ox. `slot_trace_r` (11, 46, 32) and `slot_trace_l` (-11, 46, 32) on `body` mark the ends of the traces.\n\n- Cubes: 15. Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Bounds at rest: x -15..15, y 28..63, z -59..32 u.\n- Clips: `idle`, `walk`, `run`, `pull`, `charge`, `graze`, `injured`, `death`."}